  <h1 class="max-w-5xl text-4xl font-light leading-tight text-white sm:text-6xl">Technology should make people more capable, <span class="text-retro-green">not more dependent.</span></h1>
  <p class="mt-7 max-w-3xl text-base leading-8 text-gray-400">3thousand30 exists to build practical software that ordinary people can own, understand, and use to create work that matters.</p>
